          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Sustained reductions in commercial vessel transits create immediate upstream shortages and lengthened lead times for servers, GPUs and networking hardware, causing enterprise capex delays and slower rollouts of production AI systems, lowering near‑term adoption rates." />
