          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A decline in crude throughput that tightens energy markets and lifts prices increases operating costs for data centers and raises macro risk, which depresses valuations and investor willingness to hold AI‑linked high‑growth assets, reducing measured financial exposure to AI." />
