          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rising mine incidents raise insurance costs and margin volatility for energy and transport counterparties, prompting balance-sheet retrenchment by dealers and wider bid-ask spreads in fixed-income markets, reducing liquidity." />
