          <attvalue for="35" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A rise in mine incidents attributable to actors in the escalation generates political pressure and evidentiary basis for states and coalitions to expand and tighten sanctions targeting responsible shipping firms, insurers and financial facilitators." />
