          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A jump in maritime mine incidents raises insurance costs and perceived transport risk for moving physical servers and components, incentivizing enterprises to consolidate onto a few large hyperscalers and managed providers that can guarantee hardened, redundant infrastructure, thereby increasing market concentration in AI infrastructure." />
