          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rising oil export volumes boost fiscal receipts and sovereign/energy‑sector liquidity, which are then allocated into technology and infrastructure investments, increasing the stock of financial exposure tied to AI‑linked assets." />
