          <attvalue for="35" value="0.85" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A rise in regional geopolitical conflict directly triggers more strikes, interdictions and proxy attacks in the maritime theatre as states and proxies use naval and air operations to contest shipping and signal resolve." />
