          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rapid outflows or a cutoff of cross-border bond financing to a country with key AI supply-chain roles constrains its ability to support foreign partnerships and subsidies, prompting defensive techno‑nationalist measures and export-control responses that raise US–China tech tensions." />
